<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 21.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 21.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 21	May 20   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  267.990     269.600     247.020    8.49 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  310.470     310.720     306.830    1.19 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.005     159.035     158.970    0.02 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.206	47.210	47.182    0.05 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  443.400     444.480     419.180    5.78 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.450     141.450     141.685   -0.17 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.159	16.177	16.185   -0.16 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  235.650     237.900     212.430   10.93 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.890	 1.891	 1.888    0.11 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.582	 1.582	 1.581    0.06 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.075     191.645     183.135    4.34 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
